{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-observability","title":"成本可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/cost-observability","wordCount":1426,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本可观测性\">成本可观测性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>成本可观测性通过计量中间件为每次 LLM API 调用打上多维标签（项目/用户/功能/模型/时间），实现&quot;钱花在哪了&quot;的精确归因。核心能力：实时仪表板展示成本分布和趋势、多维归因回答哪个模块最烧钱、异常检测发现突增和循环 bug、缓存效果追踪验证优化成果。没有可观测性，所有优化都是盲人摸象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"你无法优化你没有计量的东西\">你无法优化你没有计量的东西</h2><p>成本可观测性是所有优化的前提。没有精确的计量数据，路由策略在盲飞、预算分配无依据、ROI 无法量化。多数团队的第一个问题不是&quot;怎么省钱&quot;，而是&quot;钱花在哪了&quot;——他们甚至不知道哪个功能模块贡献了最多的 LLM 支出。</p>\n<p>实现成本可观测性的核心是一个<strong>计量中间件</strong>——在每次 LLM API 调用的进出路径上，采集、归因、聚合、告警。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[业务代码] --&gt; B[计量中间件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[LLM API]&#10;    C --&gt; D[响应]&#10;    D --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E[计量数据存储]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; F[实时仪表板]&#10;    E --&gt; G[成本归因报表]&#10;    E --&gt; H[异常告警]&#10;    E --&gt; I[预算追踪]&#10;&#10;    B -.-&gt;|采集| J[model / tokens / latency&lt;br/&gt;user / project / feature&lt;br/&gt;timestamp / cost]\">graph LR\n    A[业务代码] --&gt; B[计量中间件]\n    B --&gt; C[LLM API]\n    C --&gt; D[响应]\n    D --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E[计量数据存储]\n\n    E --&gt; F[实时仪表板]\n    E --&gt; G[成本归因报表]\n    E --&gt; H[异常告警]\n    E --&gt; I[预算追踪]\n\n    B -.-&gt;|采集| J[model / tokens / latency&lt;br/&gt;user / project / feature&lt;br/&gt;timestamp / cost]</pre><h2 id=\"计量中间件设计\">计量中间件设计</h2><h3 id=\"采集的核心字段\">采集的核心字段</h3><p>每次 LLM 调用需要采集的最小数据集：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td>datetime</td>\n<td>时序分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>model</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>模型维度归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>input_tokens</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>输入成本计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>output_tokens</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>输出成本计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cached_tokens</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>缓存效果追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>thinking_tokens</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>Reasoning 模型专项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>total_cost</td>\n<td>float</td>\n<td>计算后的总成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>latency_ms</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>性能监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>project</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>项目维度归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>feature</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>功能模块维度归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>user_id</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>用户维度归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>request_type</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>请求类型（路由依据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>success</td>\n<td>bool</td>\n<td>失败/重试追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cache_hit</td>\n<td>bool</td>\n<td>缓存命中追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实现方式\">实现方式</h3><p>计量中间件有三种实现路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SDK 包装器</td>\n<td>侵入最小、最快实施</td>\n<td>需要所有调用点接入</td>\n<td>小团队/起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 网关层</td>\n<td>统一拦截、无需改业务代码</td>\n<td>需要额外基础设施</td>\n<td>中大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>厂商 Dashboard</td>\n<td>零开发成本</td>\n<td>缺少业务维度归因</td>\n<td>仅基础统计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SDK 包装器示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TokenUsageRecord {&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;  model: string;&#10;  input_tokens: number;&#10;  output_tokens: number;&#10;  cached_tokens: number;&#10;  total_cost_usd: number;&#10;  latency_ms: number;&#10;  project: string;&#10;  feature: string;&#10;  user_id?: string;&#10;  success: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class CostTracker {&#10;  private records: TokenUsageRecord[] = [];&#10;&#10;  async trackedCall(&#10;    params: ChatCompletionParams,&#10;    metadata: { project: string; feature: string; user_id?: string },&#10;  ): Promise&lt;ChatCompletion&gt; {&#10;    const start = Date.now();&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;      const response = await openai.chat.completions.create(params);&#10;      const usage = response.usage!;&#10;&#10;      this.records.push({&#10;        timestamp: start,&#10;        model: params.model,&#10;        input_tokens: usage.prompt_tokens,&#10;        output_tokens: usage.completion_tokens,&#10;        cached_tokens: usage.prompt_tokens_details?.cached_tokens ?? 0,&#10;        total_cost_usd: this.calculateCost(params.model, usage),&#10;        latency_ms: Date.now() - start,&#10;        ...metadata,&#10;        success: true,&#10;      });&#10;&#10;      return response;&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      this.records.push({&#10;        timestamp: start,&#10;        model: params.model,&#10;        input_tokens: 0,&#10;        output_tokens: 0,&#10;        cached_tokens: 0,&#10;        total_cost_usd: 0,&#10;        latency_ms: Date.now() - start,&#10;        ...metadata,&#10;        success: false,&#10;      });&#10;      throw error;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenUsageRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  input_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  output_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cached_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  total_cost_usd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  latency_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  project</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  feature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CostTracker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> records</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenUsageRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trackedCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChatCompletionParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">project</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">feature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ChatCompletion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> openai.chat.completions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create<